===Etymology===
{{blend|en|camera|recorder}}. Appears to be a borrowing from {{bor|en|ja|カムコーダー}}, an original registered trademark filed for by Sony in 1981.<ref>Japan Platform for Patent Information, trademark registration number 1689742, filing date August 21, 1981; entry available online [https://www.j-platpat.inpit.go.jp/c1800/TR/JP-1981-070887/4FC0F46B8E7A21BA0717C24E9BE9E1F94955FCC7157EDD0513DBED5D3736284B/40/en here]</ref>

First cited in English to 1982.<ref name="MW">{{R:Merriam-Webster Online}}</ref>

